Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V1.0.13. The main changes are as follows:
1. Adjust the screen switching interval of the first training game to make it more operational;
2. Adjusted the time reward of the fourth training game. Even now it can increase the duration of 5 seconds;
3. The text description about the effect of partners and players in the training panel is added, so that you can understand the role of training more quickly;
4. Optimized rules for taking risks: the last character you selected will be retained (without repeating the selection step).

We have also launched the bundle of DLC. The links are as follows:
https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/18157/DLC/

Happy Max's new game will be released next week as [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/1487430/MuseNight_Out/]early access[/url], if you are interested, you can add it to the wish list.

Thank you again for your support and attention to our production team!

